quirements are as follows: 1) Completed online admissions application at: https://www.ottawa.edu/ 2) REQUIRED application fee 3) Submission of official undergraduate transcripts (3.0 GPA – minimum requirement) earned bachelor’s degree. 4) Submission of a personal statement regarding career goals and three professional references. 5) Other items as identified by the specific academic program Application Requirements Applicants must submit the following materials to be considered for employment. A completed employment application is required. Candidates should attach cover letter and resume. Share job details to Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
